{"articleNo":"506494","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=506494&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] DGU 수강신청(2/24(월) 11~18시), OCU수강신청(2/24(월) 14~18시) 안내","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2025.02.17","hit":"17333","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>DGU&nbsp;수강신청(2/24(월)&nbsp;11~18시),&nbsp;OCU수강신청(2/24(월)&nbsp;14~18시)&nbsp;안내&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">**&nbsp;OCU와&nbsp;DGU&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;저장시&nbsp;개인정보수집동의서가&nbsp;팝업으로&nbsp;안내되며&nbsp;이에&nbsp;동의하여야&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;완료됩니다.</span><br>\n<br>** DGU,&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;모두&nbsp;통합정보서비스에서&nbsp;신청(일반수강신청메뉴와&nbsp;별도)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-&nbsp;수강신청경로:&nbsp;통합정보서비스&nbsp;-&nbsp;성적&nbsp;및&nbsp;학점인정&nbsp;-&nbsp;DGU수강신청,&nbsp;&nbsp;OCU수강신청&nbsp;</span><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;유의사항&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;DGU&nbsp;및&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;모든&nbsp;과목은&nbsp;수강신청기간&nbsp;외에&nbsp;변경&nbsp;및&nbsp;삭제&nbsp;불가,</span><br></b>&nbsp; &nbsp; - <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>수강변경기간에&nbsp;DGU나&nbsp;OCU과목외의&nbsp;&nbsp;수강신청과목이&nbsp;1개밖에&nbsp;없다면&nbsp;해당과목도&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;삭제&nbsp;&nbsp;불가능함</b></span><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;DGU,&nbsp;OCU는&nbsp;&nbsp;각각&nbsp;학기당&nbsp;1개&nbsp;과목만&nbsp;수강가능하고,&nbsp;한학기에&nbsp;DGU와&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;동시수강&nbsp;가능(재학&nbsp;중&nbsp;DGU와&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;각각&nbsp;총&nbsp;2개&nbsp;과목까지&nbsp;수강&nbsp;가능)<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> -&nbsp;8학기차&nbsp;이내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;:&nbsp;DGU,&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;단독수강&nbsp;불가(수강신청기간에&nbsp;OCU와&nbsp;DGU,&nbsp;사회봉사를&nbsp;제외한&nbsp;정규과목을&nbsp;1개&nbsp;과목&nbsp;이상&nbsp;수강신청한&nbsp;경우에만&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;가능)</span><br><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;-&nbsp;학기초과자:&nbsp;&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;수강&nbsp;불가,&nbsp;&nbsp;DGU&nbsp;타교운영과목&nbsp;수강&nbsp;불가,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DGU&nbsp;본교운영과목만&nbsp;&nbsp;수강가능(단독&nbsp;수강&nbsp;가능)</span><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;타대학&nbsp;학점&nbsp;교류생&nbsp;DGU,OCU&nbsp;수강불가</span><br><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span>-&nbsp;학사학위취득유예생&nbsp;&nbsp;DGU,OCU&nbsp;수강불가</span><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;군복무중&nbsp;수강한&nbsp;OCU와&nbsp;재학&nbsp;중&nbsp;수강한&nbsp;&nbsp;OCU는&nbsp;별도로&nbsp;인정되며,&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 군복무중&nbsp;수강한&nbsp;&nbsp;OCU(군e러닝)는&nbsp;재학중&nbsp;OCU&nbsp;수강신청불가하고함&nbsp;군복무중수강한&nbsp;과목과&nbsp;재학중&nbsp;수강한&nbsp;OCU는&nbsp;동일한&nbsp;과목이라도&nbsp;서로&nbsp;재수강&nbsp;처리&nbsp;되지&nbsp;않음&nbsp;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<u><b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;DGU&nbsp;중&nbsp;본교운영과목은&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;후&nbsp;본교과목&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;내역으로&nbsp;이관되나,&nbsp;수강&nbsp;정정기간에도&nbsp;변경할&nbsp;&nbsp;수&nbsp;없음</b></u><br>\n<br>\n**&nbsp;자세한&nbsp;사항은&nbsp;아래&nbsp;관련&nbsp;공지를&nbsp;반드시&nbsp;확인&nbsp;후&nbsp;수강신청을&nbsp;진행하여&nbsp;주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.<br>\n<br>\nDGU&nbsp;수강신청:&nbsp;2월&nbsp;24일(월)&nbsp;11시&nbsp;~18시<br>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=505705&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=U&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">DGU&nbsp;공지&nbsp;바로가기&nbsp;(새창&nbsp;열기)</a></span><br>\n<br>\nOCU&nbsp;수강신청:&nbsp;2월&nbsp;24일(월)&nbsp;14시&nbsp;~&nbsp;&nbsp;18시<br>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=505704&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10&amp;srSearchVal=U&amp;srSearchKey=article_title\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">OCU&nbsp;공지&nbsp;바로가기(새창&nbsp;열기)</a></span><br>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
